<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>MCP Architecture Spec: {{ spec_name }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>MCP Architecture Spec: {{ spec_name }}</h1>
<h2>Context</h2>
<ul><li>slug: mcp-architecture</li><li>owner: &lt;role:person&gt;</li><li>approver: &lt;role:person&gt;</li><li>produced_at: &lt;YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ&gt;</li><li>use case: &lt;data and tools exposed; from product&gt;</li><li>hosts: &lt;Claude Desktop / VS Code / custom SDK app; from host catalogue&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Protocol version (rule r1)</h2>
<ul><li>protocol_version: <code>&lt;protocol_version&gt;</code> (YYYY-MM-DD, e.g. 2025-11-25)</li><li>negotiation: server advertises this version in <code>initialize</code>; client rejects on mismatch</li><li>upgrade plan: &lt;who re-pins, trigger, test gate&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Primitives (rule r2)</h2>
<p>Tools = actions (mutate, compute). Resources = read-only data. Prompts = templates.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Side effects</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>tool</td><td>{{ tools }}</td><td>&lt;what it does&gt;</td><td>{{ mutates_computes }}</td></tr><tr><td>resource</td><td>{{ resources }}</td><td>&lt;URI prefix and data served&gt;</td><td>none</td></tr><tr><td>prompt</td><td>{{ prompts }}</td><td>{{ template_intent }}</td><td>none</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Misclassification check: &lt;any resource that writes, any tool that only reads&gt;</p>
<h2>Transport (rule r3)</h2>
<ul><li>transport: <code>&lt;transport&gt;</code> (stdio / http_sse / streamable_http)</li><li>scope: {{ scope }}</li><li>rationale: &lt;stdio for local desktop hosts; HTTP for remote or multi-tenant&gt;</li><li>decision-tree path: &lt;branch taken in content/06-decision-tree.xml&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Auth (rule r4)</h2>
<ul><li>auth_method: <code>&lt;auth_method&gt;</code> (none_local / oauth2.1_pkce / api_key)</li><li>rule: stdio -&gt; none_local; any remote transport -&gt; oauth2.1_pkce</li><li>authorization server: {{ authorization_server }}</li><li>scopes: {{ scopes }}</li><li>api_key justification (if used): &lt;why PKCE is not possible; approver sign-off&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Tool description policy (rule r5)</h2>
<ul><li>descriptions are plain statements of behaviour, no instructions to the model</li><li>host renders descriptions in a distinguishable surface, never inlined into the system prompt</li><li>review owner: &lt;role:person&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Capability attestation (rule r6)</h2>
<ul><li>declared capabilities: &lt;tools / resources / prompts / logging; exactly what the server registers&gt;</li><li>undeclared methods: rejected by the client with {{ undeclared_methods }}</li><li>manifest or identity: &lt;signed manifest / pinned cert / n/a for stdio&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Output (content/02-output-contract.xml)</h2>
<pre><code class="language-json">{
  &quot;spec_name&quot;: &quot;&lt;spec_name&gt;&quot;,
  &quot;protocol_version&quot;: &quot;&lt;protocol_version&gt;&quot;,
  &quot;primitives&quot;: {
    &quot;tools&quot;: [&lt;tools&gt;],
    &quot;resources&quot;: [&lt;resources&gt;],
    &quot;prompts&quot;: [&lt;prompts&gt;]
  },
  &quot;transport&quot;: &quot;&lt;transport&gt;&quot;,
  &quot;auth_method&quot;: &quot;&lt;auth_method&gt;&quot;
}</code></pre>
<h2>Review</h2>
<ul><li>validator: <code>python3 scripts/validate-mcp-architecture.py --file &lt;out.json&gt;</code></li><li>cadence: monthly | quarterly</li><li>next_review_at: &lt;YYYY-MM-DD&gt;</li><li>outcome: &lt;filled at next review&gt;</li></ul>
</body></html>
